OL,3,ANowak family say police failed them
OL,4,Amultiple times
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe remarks came in a second excerpt
OL,7,Freleased by ITV from the forthcoming
OL,8,Fdocumentary Dear Henry: Our Fight For
OL,9,FJustice. Chief Constable Alexis Boon
OL,10,Fhas apologised to the family and said
OL,11,Fthat when Henry "needed us most, we
OL,12,Ffailed him".
